  "instructions": [
    "Heat the chicken broth in a large paella pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the paella rice and cook, stirring occasionally, until lightly toasted.",
    "Add the chicken and cook until browned.",
    "Add the patis, coconut milk, and saffron threads (with their liquid).",
    "Stir in the longganisa and mayonnaise.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20-25 minutes.",
